        <value xsi:type="xsd:string">&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Snapshot:&lt;/strong&gt; The Snapshot button captures the current state into a Dashboard Run record so you can compare to today&apos;s data later.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Export:&lt;/strong&gt; Queues a per-component export job. Each tile&apos;s data is written out individually so large datasets don&apos;t time out.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Edit:&lt;/strong&gt; Jumps straight to Dashboard Builder for the current dashboard.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Polling cadence:&lt;/strong&gt; Run status updates arrive in real time via empApi events; a 10-second polling fallback covers the case where event delivery is delayed.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</value>
